Detected Language: zh (Prob: 1.00)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Segment #1   [00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,280] | Elapsed:  18.61s | Words: 8  | Text: 只要你敢不斷淘汰
Segment #2   [00:00:01,280 --> 00:00:01,960] | Elapsed:  18.61s | Words: 4  | Text: 烂人烂事
Segment #3   [00:00:01,960 --> 00:00:03,460] | Elapsed:  18.61s | Words: 9  | Text: 你的生活就过得越来越好
Segment #4   [00:00:03,460 --> 00:00:04,880] | Elapsed:  18.61s | Words: 9  | Text: 因为这稍微是很现实的
Segment #5   [00:00:04,880 --> 00:00:06,080] | Elapsed:  18.61s | Words: 8  | Text: 你不淘汰这些垃圾
Segment #6   [00:00:06,080 --> 00:00:07,920] | Elapsed:  18.61s | Words: 12 | Text: 这些垃圾就是反过来去消耗你
Segment #7   [00:00:07,920 --> 00:00:08,640] | Elapsed:  18.61s | Words: 4  | Text: 那怎么识别
Segment #8   [00:00:08,640 --> 00:00:09,500] | Elapsed:  18.61s | Words: 5  | Text: 谁是垃圾呢
Segment #9   [00:00:09,500 --> 00:00:10,000] | Elapsed:  18.61s | Words: 3  | Text: 很简单
Segment #10  [00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:11,360] | Elapsed:  18.61s | Words: 5  | Text: 就是通过看自己
Segment #11  [00:00:11,360 --> 00:00:12,320] | Elapsed:  18.61s | Words: 6  | Text: 学会观察别人
Segment #12  [00:00:12,320 --> 00:00:13,960] | Elapsed:  18.61s | Words: 8  | Text: 当你能够看清楚自己的时候
Segment #13  [00:00:13,960 --> 00:00:15,600] | Elapsed:  18.61s | Words: 9  | Text: 你也就能看清楚别人了
Segment #14  [00:00:15,600 --> 00:00:16,500] | Elapsed:  18.61s | Words: 6  | Text: 就在我的认知里
Segment #15  [00:00:16,500 --> 00:00:17,420] | Elapsed:  18.61s | Words: 6  | Text: 我说的简单点
Segment #16  [00:00:17,420 --> 00:00:19,380] | Elapsed:  18.61s | Words: 10 | Text: 只要这个人过来跟我聊感情
Segment #17  [00:00:19,380 --> 00:00:20,480] | Elapsed:  18.61s | Words: 6  | Text: 聊道德 聊帮助
Segment #18  [00:00:20,480 --> 00:00:22,140] | Elapsed:  18.61s | Words: 10 | Text: 就是不谈任何实际的利润
Segment #19  [00:00:22,140 --> 00:00:22,840] | Elapsed:  18.61s | Words: 4  | Text: 那都是垃圾
Segment #20  [00:00:22,840 --> 00:00:23,860] | Elapsed:  18.61s | Words: 6  | Text: 我就拿我妈举例
Segment #21  [00:00:23,860 --> 00:00:26,620] | Elapsed:  18.61s | Words: 13 | Text: 我妈一进门就是说的每一句话就是
Segment #22  [00:00:26,620 --> 00:00:27,680] | Elapsed:  41.24s | Words: 5  | Text: 不是我该帮谁
Segment #23  [00:00:27,680 --> 00:00:28,980] | Elapsed:  41.24s | Words: 7  | Text: 就是我应该去看看谁
Segment #24  [00:00:28,980 --> 00:00:30,520] | Elapsed:  41.24s | Words: 7  | Text: 你觉得我得怎么沟通
Segment #25  [00:00:30,520 --> 00:00:31,940] | Elapsed:  41.24s | Words: 9  | Text: 你回到公司的角度上
Segment #26  [00:00:31,940 --> 00:00:33,180] | Elapsed:  41.24s | Words: 4  | Text: 也是一个道理
Segment #27  [00:00:33,180 --> 00:00:34,040] | Elapsed:  41.24s | Words: 6  | Text: 你作为一个老板
Segment #28  [00:00:34,040 --> 00:00:35,500] | Elapsed:  41.24s | Words: 7  | Text: 第一看的是什么是业绩
Segment #29  [00:00:35,500 --> 00:00:37,460] | Elapsed:  41.24s | Words: 9  | Text: 第二看的是什么是沟通能力
Segment #30  [00:00:37,460 --> 00:00:39,780] | Elapsed:  41.24s | Words: 13 | Text: 如果这个人一枚业绩而没沟通能力
Segment #31  [00:00:39,780 --> 00:00:41,380] | Elapsed:  41.24s | Words: 9  | Text: 那你需要做的就是淘汰他
Segment #32  [00:00:41,380 --> 00:00:43,000] | Elapsed:  41.24s | Words: 10 | Text: 那回够到家庭和生活当中
Segment #33  [00:00:43,000 --> 00:00:44,180] | Elapsed:  41.24s | Words: 6  | Text: 也是同样的道理
Segment #34  [00:00:44,180 --> 00:00:45,420] | Elapsed:  41.24s | Words: 8  | Text: 或许之前这个人是对的
Segment #35  [00:00:45,420 --> 00:00:46,600] | Elapsed:  41.24s | Words: 6  | Text: 但是他开始不进步
Segment #36  [00:00:46,600 --> 00:00:47,240] | Elapsed:  41.24s | Words: 4  | Text: 开始不学习
Segment #37  [00:00:47,240 --> 00:00:49,080] | Elapsed:  41.24s | Words: 10 | Text: 开始跟不上成长的队伍的时候
Segment #38  [00:00:49,080 --> 00:00:50,460] | Elapsed:  41.24s | Words: 7  | Text: 他一样该被淘汰
Segment #39  [00:00:50,460 --> 00:00:51,700] | Elapsed:  41.24s | Words: 6  | Text: 不要想着去帮他
Segment #40  [00:00:51,700 --> 00:00:53,620] | Elapsed:  41.24s | Words: 12 | Text: 无底线的帮助就是你获得那开始
Segment #41  [00:00:53,620 --> 00:00:54,800] | Elapsed:  41.24s | Words: 5  | Text: 因为认知低的人
Segment #42  [00:00:54,800 --> 00:00:55,860] | Elapsed:  41.24s | Words: 5  | Text: 他是没有良心的
Segment #43  [00:00:55,860 --> 00:00:56,980] | Elapsed:  62.29s | Words: 5  | Text: 在他的角度里
Segment #44  [00:00:56,980 --> 00:00:58,040] | Elapsed:  62.29s | Words: 7  | Text: 这就是你应该做的
Segment #45  [00:00:58,040 --> 00:00:59,320] | Elapsed:  62.29s | Words: 5  | Text: 因为我是你的发小
Segment #46  [00:00:59,320 --> 00:01:00,380] | Elapsed:  62.29s | Words: 4  | Text: 我是你的同学
Segment #47  [00:01:00,380 --> 00:01:01,840] | Elapsed:  62.29s | Words: 4  | Text: 我是你的闺蜜
Segment #48  [00:01:01,840 --> 00:01:03,260] | Elapsed:  62.29s | Words: 8  | Text: 我是这家公司的元老
Segment #49  [00:01:03,260 --> 00:01:04,920] | Elapsed:  62.29s | Words: 7  | Text: 这都是你应该做的
Segment #50  [00:01:04,920 --> 00:01:06,980] | Elapsed:  62.29s | Words: 12 | Text: 所以说不要去免费的帮助任何人
Segment #51  [00:01:06,980 --> 00:01:07,800] | Elapsed:  62.29s | Words: 4  | Text: 这就是他的命
Segment #52  [00:01:07,800 --> 00:01:08,940] | Elapsed:  62.29s | Words: 5  | Text: 我们需要做的就是
Segment #53  [00:01:09,360 --> 00:01:10,380] | Elapsed:  62.29s | Words: 5  | Text: 不断的筛选
Segment #54  [00:01:10,380 --> 00:01:11,380] | Elapsed:  62.29s | Words: 5  | Text: 不断的淘汰
Segment #55  [00:01:11,380 --> 00:01:12,760] | Elapsed:  62.29s | Words: 6  | Text: 因为在现在这个社会
Segment #56  [00:01:12,760 --> 00:01:13,300] | Elapsed:  62.29s | Words: 3  | Text: 我告诉你
Segment #57  [00:01:13,300 --> 00:01:14,580] | Elapsed:  62.29s | Words: 6  | Text: 他就是漏赌机制
Segment #58  [00:01:14,580 --> 00:01:16,440] | Elapsed:  62.29s | Words: 8  | Text: 转身就是在筛选那些
Segment #59  [00:01:16,440 --> 00:01:17,740] | Elapsed:  62.29s | Words: 7  | Text: 愿意为你付费的人
Segment #60  [00:01:17,740 --> 00:01:19,140] | Elapsed:  62.29s | Words: 6  | Text: 情感也是在筛选
Segment #61  [00:01:19,140 --> 00:01:20,240] | Elapsed:  62.29s | Words: 7  | Text: 筛选那些对你们好的
Segment #62  [00:01:20,240 --> 00:01:20,880] | Elapsed:  62.30s | Words: 2  | Text: 对不对
Segment #63  [00:01:20,880 --> 00:01:22,340] | Elapsed:  62.30s | Words: 7  | Text: 社交他也是在筛选
Segment #64  [00:01:22,340 --> 00:01:24,060] | Elapsed:  62.30s | Words: 8  | Text: 筛选一些对你们有利的
Segment #65  [00:01:24,060 --> 00:01:25,280] | Elapsed:  62.30s | Words: 8  | Text: 当你真正的理解了
Segment #66  [00:01:25,280 --> 00:01:26,800] | Elapsed:  80.56s | Words: 7  | Text: 这个道理你就好明白了
Segment #67  [00:01:26,800 --> 00:01:27,840] | Elapsed:  80.56s | Words: 5  | Text: 朋友不行咱就换
Segment #68  [00:01:27,840 --> 00:01:29,320] | Elapsed:  80.56s | Words: 6  | Text: 对象不行咱也换
Segment #69  [00:01:29,320 --> 00:01:30,740] | Elapsed:  80.56s | Words: 8  | Text: 兄弟拉近就让他滚
Segment #70  [00:01:30,740 --> 00:01:32,080] | Elapsed:  80.56s | Words: 7  | Text: 只要你敢不停的
Segment #71  [00:01:32,080 --> 00:01:33,380] | Elapsed:  80.56s | Words: 8  | Text: 不断的去淘汰别人
Segment #72  [00:01:33,380 --> 00:01:34,480] | Elapsed:  80.56s | Words: 4  | Text: 那么你的日子
Segment #73  [00:01:34,480 --> 00:01:35,500] | Elapsed:  80.56s | Words: 8  | Text: 就会过得越来越深
Segment #74  [00:01:35,500 --> 00:01:36,460] | Elapsed:  80.56s | Words: 4  | Text: 只要人不行
Segment #75  [00:01:36,460 --> 00:01:36,940] | Elapsed:  80.56s | Words: 2  | Text: 那就换
Segment #76  [00:01:36,940 --> 00:01:37,900] | Elapsed:  80.56s | Words: 4  | Text: 就是不管他是谁
Segment #77  [00:01:37,900 --> 00:01:38,500] | Elapsed:  80.56s | Words: 3  | Text: 爱谁谁
Segment #78  [00:01:38,500 --> 00:01:39,560] | Elapsed:  80.56s | Words: 7  | Text: 不要光聊任何道理
Segment #79  [00:01:39,560 --> 00:01:40,940] | Elapsed:  80.56s | Words: 6  | Text: 聊帮助聊道德
Segment #80  [00:01:40,940 --> 00:01:41,680] | Elapsed:  80.56s | Words: 4  | Text: 这我告诉你
Segment #81  [00:01:41,680 --> 00:01:42,580] | Elapsed:  80.56s | Words: 5  | Text: 全部都是扯淡的
Segment #82  [00:01:42,580 --> 00:01:43,860] | Elapsed:  80.56s | Words: 7  | Text: 人不行就直接让他滚
Segment #83  [00:01:43,860 --> 00:01:45,120] | Elapsed:  80.56s | Words: 7  | Text: 就这么简单的道理
Segment #84  [00:01:45,120 --> 00:01:45,960] | Elapsed:  80.56s | Words: 4  | Text: 加油陌生人
Segment #85  [00:01:45,960 --> 00:01:47,100] | Elapsed:  80.57s | Words: 6  | Text: 祝你们越来越好
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
